/* ================================================================ story: a year at Critical Point ================================================================
   The long campaign: 52 weekly chapters, three episodes each, following one year of your career from new reactor operator to shift supervisor.
   A new chapter opens each real week (and only once you have played at least one episode of the last), so it takes a year to see the end.
   The months carry the story: winter storms and frozen intakes, the regulator's inspection, the spring refuelling outage and the start-up after it,
   summer heat and warm sea water, mentoring a new trainee, autumn gales, a grid emergency, and the Christmas peak. Episodes are built from the
   plant's own goals (load changes, steady running, faults, full start-ups and shutdowns) with the crew talking you through, questions that test
   what you know, stars for each one, XP and money, and promotions at the end of each quarter. */
